{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And much cattle, etc.</b> The reason for this declaration is to justify the verse — the reason found on their lips for asking for the land of Sihon and Og, for it is true. And the reason they had [cattle] more than all the tribes is that they were mighty men of strength; they plundered the men of the army [and took] a portion greater than all the tribes."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:16:23.232453501Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}